ETHICAL USE DISCLAIMER:

This security scanning tool is intended for authorized security assessments only.
Users must obtain explicit written permission before scanning any systems they
do not own. Unauthorized network scanning may violate:

- Computer Fraud and Abuse Act (CFAA) in the United States
- Computer Misuse Act in the United Kingdom
- Similar laws in other jurisdictions

The author and contributors:
- Assume no liability for misuse of this software
- Do not condone illegal or unauthorized use
- Recommend following responsible disclosure practices
- Encourage ethical security research and defensive security practices

By using this software, you agree to:
1. Only scan systems you own or have written permission to test
2. Comply with all applicable laws and regulations
3. Use findings for defensive security purposes only
4. Not use this tool for malicious purposes

If you discover vulnerabilities using this tool, please follow responsible
disclosure practices and report them to the affected organizations.
